@ENTER RT,,,10
@ABORT XFTRAD
@SCHEDULE 503
@RT-LOADER
CLEAR-SEGMENT XFTRAD
YES
NEW-SEGMENT XFTRAD,2,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
READ-PROGFILE (COSMOS-BASIC)COS-XFTRA-E02,,,,,
END-LOAD
DECLARE-PROGRAM XFTRAD,,
CHANGE-RT-DESCRIPTION XFTRAD 30 XFTRAD,,0,,,,,,
EXIT-LOADER

@CC Remote batch logical device at address 61465:
@CC 0=no batch, 1237=batch 1, 1241=batch 2, etc.
@CC Timeoutvalue at address 61641 (in seconds, octal value)
@LOOK S XFTRAD
61465/1241
61641/74
.
@CC
